        "advancement": {},
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The worg unleashes an unnatural howl audible out to a distance of 300 feet. Each creature of the worg’s choice within 30 feet of it must succeed on a [[/save]] save or be frightened of it for 1 minute. A frightened creature can repeat the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. Until it finishes a long rest, the worg can sense the direction but not the exact location of each creature that was frightened by Loathsome Howl.</p>",
          "source": {}
